<title>UK: DSL Bank sets 300 billion lire five-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank sets 300 billion lire five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris, Credit Suisse First Boston and San Paolo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    27.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.622   PAY DATE    27.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/IBCA AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
